{"overview":"Everyman Coupeau's attempts to stop drinking are routinely thwarted by the wicked and vengeful Virginie. Based on Zola's novel, Capellani's film is about the free fall of a group of working-class French folk into degradation and tragedy due to carelessness, jealousy, and alcohol abuse. At the time of its release, L'Assommoir was hugely successful.","tagline":"","cast":[{"n":"Alexandre Arquillière","c":"Coupeau","p":"/2JjNOu13nQxv815bqw0F7ige4MF.jpg","q":"Q2833413"},{"n":"Jacques Grétillat","c":"Lantier","p":"/jUkAT7ViqcvBl707AhOcjb11hXf.jpg","q":"Q3159044"},{"n":"Jacques Varennes","c":"","p":"/puHGEHelKVJg5URN70nQUueGnDv.jpg","q":null},{"n":"Gabrielle Réjane","c":"","p":"/8YRZQ6KkdaIRIDmshiqCbCjMjMt.jpg","q":null},{"n":"Eugénie Nau","c":"Gervaise","p":"/y54ftYYHljXAJ3DtngBJQOyRFHY.jpg","q":null},{"n":"Antoine","c":"","p":null,"q":null},{"n":"Henri Gouget","c":"","p":"/A1bTm78pQFOh9enFoLmKDAm9TIl.jpg","q":null},{"n":"Catherine Fonteney","c":"Virginie","p":"/8Kug9poJiIDMUwxHZNs00h1LbtT.jpg","q":"Q2941921"},{"n":"Mansuelle","c":"Mes-Bottes","p":null,"q":null},{"n":"Bazin","c":"Bec-Salé","p":null,"q":null}],"country":["France"],"language":[],"wiki":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/L%27Assommoir_(film)","qid":"Q3202475"}